WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.067
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:05.801
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:07.567
What a show we have for you
tonight.

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:09.501
Hailey Bieber is here tonight!

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:12.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.567
tWitch is here tonight.

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:16.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:18.968
We have music from
Phoebe Bridgers.

00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:21.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:24.601
From the new movie "Elvis" --
and let me tell you something.

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:27.033
This kid is unbelievable.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:28.601
Put your money on this guy, man.

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:30.067
Oh, my gosh.

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.133
Austin Butler is here tonight.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:35.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.868
That is right.

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:39.100
Elvis is in the building
tonight.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:44.734
Speaking of movies, everyone's
talking about this today.

00:00:44.734 --> 00:00:46.234
I don't know if you saw.
It was all over the place.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:50.000
Warner Bros. released the first
picture of Ryan Gosling as Ken

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.601
in the upcoming "Barbie" movie.

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:55.167
This is real.
Here's the picture.

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.434
This is real. Here he is.

00:00:56.434 --> 00:01:01.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.434
That's also what comes up
when you Google

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:05.267
"sexy Guy Fieri Halloween
costume."

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:06.267
Just saying.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:07.834
Can we see it again?

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:10.033
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:12.701
It looks like Draco Malfoy if he
went to Barry's Bootcamp.

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:16.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:18.067
Yeah, that's right.
He's the total package.

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:19.334
Well, minus the package.

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:20.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.501 --> 00:01:22.667
It's Ken. It's Ken.
It's a Ken joke.

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:24.901
Smooth.

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:26.400
-Let's get to some news here,
everyone.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.501
I read that Dr. Fauci has tested
positive for COVID.

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:32.501
But luckily, he's only
experiencing mild symptoms.

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:34.067
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:35.601
COVID must feel like
it just reached

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:37.067
the final boss in a video game.

00:01:37.067 --> 00:01:39.167
[ Laughter ]
Like, "Yo, we did it.

00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:42.868
We did it.
We got -- We beat Fauci."

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:44.934
That's right.
Dr. Fauci has COVID.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:47.534
Right now, even he's reading
the CDC guidelines like,

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:48.767
"Damn, these are confusing."

00:01:48.767 --> 00:01:50.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:52.734
"Isolate for five days
then quarantine.

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:54.501
What do I do?"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.734 --> 00:01:58.400
Did you guys hear about this?

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:01.934
Amid a salmonella outbreak,
the CDC has instructed people

00:02:01.934 --> 00:02:05.167
not to kiss or snuggle
their chickens.

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:07.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:09.734
Although, if you're kissing
and snuggling chickens,

00:02:09.734 --> 00:02:11.767
I'm not sure salmonella
is your biggest issue.

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:13.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.200
Yeah.
-Eggs.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.067
-When the news broke,
Dr. Fauci was like,

00:02:18.067 --> 00:02:20.033
"Well, my day just keeps getting
worse and worse."

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:21.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.934 --> 00:02:24.100
Well, get this. I heard that
since taking office,

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.634
President Biden has seen
his approval rating drop

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:28.567
the most among young voters.

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:30.834
Yeah, well, I think he's trying
to win young voters back.

00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:33.934
Check out this new ad
the White House just released.

00:02:33.934 --> 00:02:36.801
-What's up, fam?
You know who's got you?

00:02:36.801 --> 00:02:38.934
The only president who's
straight up bussin'.

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:40.234
Joe Biden.

00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:42.367
President B is clapping back
on the haters with --

00:02:42.367 --> 00:02:45.834
-Sensible bipartisan policies.

00:02:45.834 --> 00:02:48.567
-We ain't trying to simp.
We're just spilling the tea.

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:50.300
Because we've got BPE.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:51.868
-Big president energy.

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:55.133
-So support Joe Biden today
because our White House daddy

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:57.968
is about to go goblin mode
on inflation.

00:02:57.968 --> 00:02:59.801
[ Goat screams ]

00:02:59.801 --> 00:03:01.901
-This ad was paid for by
a group of 50-year-old men

00:03:01.901 --> 00:03:03.434
who just found out about
Urban Dictionary.

00:03:03.434 --> 00:03:04.567
-There you go.
It's doing very --

00:03:04.567 --> 00:03:09.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:09.634 --> 00:03:11.133
Goblin mode.
-Yeah.

00:03:11.133 --> 00:03:13.601
-Yeah. Hey, guys.
I don't know if you heard this.

00:03:13.601 --> 00:03:17.234
Molson Coors is pulling Coors
Light and Keystone Light from

00:03:17.234 --> 00:03:19.667
stores after a viral video
showed cans

00:03:19.667 --> 00:03:21.400
filled with a thick liquid.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.901
[ Audience groans ]

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:24.901
Yeah, some stores returned them

00:03:24.901 --> 00:03:26.634
while others just relabeled them
Guinness.

00:03:26.634 --> 00:03:29.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:30.868
I don't know about you,
but I like a beer

00:03:30.868 --> 00:03:32.200
that you can eat
with a honey dripper.

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.601 --> 00:03:35.968
Well, today, after 27 years,

00:03:35.968 --> 00:03:38.901
Microsoft officially shut down
Internet Explorer.

00:03:38.901 --> 00:03:40.133
[ Audience awws ]

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:41.901
Yeah, you could tell
it was getting old

00:03:41.901 --> 00:03:43.667
'cause there were errors
like this coming up.

00:03:43.667 --> 00:03:45.868
First, "Error 404:
can't find my glasses.

00:03:45.868 --> 00:03:47.634
Oh, wait, they're on my head."

00:03:47.634 --> 00:03:49.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:50.334
Look at this error.

00:03:50.334 --> 00:03:51.834
"Error: Internet Explorer
stopped working.

00:03:51.834 --> 00:03:53.701
Now it collect Civil War
medallions."

00:03:53.701 --> 00:03:56.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.467 --> 00:03:58.267
-Wow.
-You can tell it's getting old.

00:03:58.267 --> 00:03:59.634
Look at this.
Finally, this error says,

00:03:59.634 --> 00:04:01.167
"Error: Internet Explorer
is busy buying

00:04:01.167 --> 00:04:02.934
a reverse mortgage
from Tom Selleck."

00:04:02.934 --> 00:04:06.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:06.501 --> 00:04:08.300
Maybe it's good that
they shut it down.

00:04:09.634 --> 00:04:13.133
Well, guys, I just saw a new
design for airplane seats.

00:04:13.133 --> 00:04:14.667
And I'm not sure
how I feel about it.

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:15.834
Take a look at this.

00:04:15.834 --> 00:04:18.367
-It's called double-decker
seating.

00:04:18.367 --> 00:04:19.901
This is the design.

00:04:19.901 --> 00:04:24.334
It fits two levels of seats
inside a normal airplane.

00:04:24.334 --> 00:04:27.167
So your legs go straight out
in front of you

00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:30.868
with someone basically
sitting above them.

00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:33.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.100
-COVID or not,
if you're on the bottom,

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.300
you're going to want
to wear a mask.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:39.367
[ Laughter ]
I just think -- I just think --

00:04:39.367 --> 00:04:41.400
-Odor.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.033
-It's going to be fun when
the flight attendant's like,

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:45.167
"Tonight's in-flight snack
is whatever the guy

00:04:45.167 --> 00:04:48.467
above you is eating."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.467 --> 00:04:50.501
Cheez-Its. Cheez-Its.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.734
And finally, I know a lot of
people find math boring.

00:04:55.734 --> 00:04:58.234
Well, that's why we've updated
math to make the equations

00:04:58.234 --> 00:04:59.834
about stuff
that you can relate to.

00:04:59.834 --> 00:05:02.234
It's time for
"Popular Mathematics."

00:05:02.234 --> 00:05:04.501
♪♪

00:05:04.501 --> 00:05:07.534
-♪ Popular mathematics ♪

00:05:07.534 --> 00:05:09.367
♪ Mathematics ♪

00:05:09.367 --> 00:05:11.634
-Let's take a look at
our first equation here.

00:05:11.634 --> 00:05:14.734
If you take clogs
plus a hole punch

00:05:14.734 --> 00:05:15.934
equals Crocs.

00:05:15.934 --> 00:05:18.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:18.667 --> 00:05:20.567
Popular mathematics.
-Very popular.

00:05:20.567 --> 00:05:24.667
-So, if you take Bill Clinton
plus nothing to do

00:05:24.667 --> 00:05:28.000
plus a heat wave plus 100

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.300
equals the Billboard Hot 100.

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:34.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.100
-Wow. Bill Bored. Hot 100.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:40.567
-If you take The Penguin...
-Right.

00:05:40.567 --> 00:05:42.167
-...plus six pints of Guinness,

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:44.200
it equals the Boston Celtics
mascot.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:49.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:49.634 --> 00:05:50.734
How about this one?

00:05:50.734 --> 00:05:52.634
Here's a "kiss the chef" apron

00:05:52.634 --> 00:05:54.534
plus a complaint to HR

00:05:54.534 --> 00:05:56.968
equals "firm handshake the chef"
apron.

00:05:56.968 --> 00:06:02.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:02.267 --> 00:06:05.234
If you take Cheetos
plus Chachi...

00:06:05.234 --> 00:06:08.701
-Uh-oh.
-...plus chicken plus euphoria

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:10.734
it equals Ch-Ch-Ch-Chia.

00:06:10.734 --> 00:06:14.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.901
And finally, if you take
a Twinkie plus googly eyes

00:06:19.901 --> 00:06:21.234
plus $4 billion,

00:06:21.234 --> 00:06:23.133
it equals the Minions franchise.

00:06:23.133 --> 00:06:24.834
There you have it.
That's all the time we have

00:06:24.834 --> 00:06:26.300
for "Popular Mathematics."

